LC closing requires checked constants, original identities, strata, cuts, covers, inclusions and outcomes reused by complete content across compatible tiles, with graph-local authenticated pi citations instead of per-call finite-sum validation. Prepare exact authority once per reusable scope and charge each actual barrier lookup, new proof, attachment and independent replay separately. Governing obligations: (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-cas-owner`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-cache-evidence`), (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-cache-charge`), (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-replay`), (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-decision-cache`), (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-pi-reuse`), (`req:nrz:lc-evaluation-cache-evidence`).

