LC closing requires reusable checked tile templates, complete shape/layout/guard/companion compatibility keys and current application validation. Shared pi and index-independent numerical nodes use one compatible prelude; exact authority survives flush separately from the fresh numerical imports required afterward. Governing obligations: (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-bindings-owner`), (`def:nrz:tiles-streams-lowered-lambda`), (`def:nrz:tiles-streams-lowering-key`), (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-lowering-application`), (`rule:nrz:tiles-streams-hoisting`), (`rule:nrz:lc-evaluation-hoisting`).

