LC closing requires coverage of every caller/private/discarded ledger and transient construction, exclusive same-ledger phase receipts with remainder, joined decision attempts and separate native work, memory and replay. Sampling and tracing preserve deterministic Work and all existing limits; missing observer coverage cannot substantiate zero work. Governing obligations: (`req:nrz:lc-evaluation-accounting`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-work-trace-layer`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-accounting-coverage`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-accounting-claims`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-accounting-fixtures`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-observer-evidence`), (`req:nrz:lc-grid-acceptance-evidence`), (`req:nrz:lc-stream-acceptance-evidence`).

