After implementing tiles, streams and the LC evaluation design, LC closing requires recorded reruns of the specified cell recipes on the tiled path, including an ordinary positive nonsquare L by C grid, through the declared populations and an actual run to 10⁹ cells. A smaller run or fitted projection cannot meet this claim. Publish exact Work beside raw independent wall timings, with setup, each fresh answer, barrier hit/miss, refinement, replay, publication and flush separately attributed; include bounded memory and stream latency/throughput. Governing obligations: (`sec:nrz:lc-grid-acceptance`), (`req:nrz:lc-grid-benchmark`), (`req:nrz:lc-grid-fit`), (`req:nrz:lc-grid-counters`), (`req:nrz:tiles-streams-scaling-evidence`), (`req:nrz:lc-evaluation-cost-probe`), (`req:nrz:lc-evaluation-scaling`), (`req:nrz:lc-stream-latency-evidence`), (`dec:nrz:lc-resonance-delivery-contract`).

